{"chapter":"b2-67-argumentieren-gegenargumente","level":"B2","number":67,"title":"Argumentieren: Gegenargumente","rows":[{"section":"story","type":"story-line","idx":1,"text":"Ich möchte ein Gegenargument nennen Viele Mitarbeiter fühlen sich einsam im Homeoffice","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","control":"button.story-play-line","chapter":"b2-67-argumentieren-gegenargumente","level":"B2"},{"section":"story","type":"story-line","idx":2,"text":"Ich räume ein dass das ein echtes Problem ist","speaker":"Katrin","voiceRole":"female","control":"button.story-play-line","chapter":"b2-67-argumentieren-gegenargumente","level":"B2"},{"section":"story","type":"story-line","idx":3,"text":"Wie würdest du meinen Einwand widerlegen","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","control":"button.story-play-line","chapter":"b2-67-argumentieren-gegenargumente","level":"B2"},{"section":"story","type":"story-line","idx":4,"text":"Ich würde sagen dass regelmäßige Treffen helfen","speaker":"Katrin","voiceRole":"female","control":"button.story-play-line","chapter":"b2-67-argumentieren-gegenargumente","level":"B2"},{"section":"story","type":"story-line","idx":5,"text":"Das ist ein ausgewogener Standpunkt","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","control":"button.story-play-line","chapter":"b2-67-argumentieren-gegenargumente","level":"B2"},{"section":"story","type":"story-line","idx":6,"text":"Danke Ich finde den Kompromiss sinnvoll","speaker":"Katrin","voiceRole":"female","control":"button.story-play-line","chapter":"b2-67-argumentieren-gegenargumente","level":"B2"},{"section":"vocabulary","type":"vocab-headword","idx":1,"text":"das Gegenargument","voiceRole":"female","pos":"noun","gender":"n","control":"button.vword-voice[data-g=female]","chapter":"b2-67-argumentieren-gegenargumente","level":"B2"},{"section":"vocabulary","type":"vocab-headword","idx":1,"text":"das Gegenargument","voiceRole":"male","pos":"noun","gender":"n","control":"button.vword-voice[data-g=male]","chapter":"b2-67-argumentieren-gegenargumente","level":"B2"},{"section":"vocabulary","type":"vocab-headword","idx":2,"text":"einräumen","voiceRole":"female","pos":"verb","control":"button.vword-voice[data-g=female]","chapter":"b2-67-argumentieren-gegenargumente","level":"B2"},{"section":"vocabulary","type":"vocab-headword","idx":2,"text":"einräumen","voiceRole":"male","pos":"verb","control":"button.vword-voice[data-g=male]","chapter":"b2-67-argumentieren-gegenargumente","level":"B2"},{"section":"vocabulary","type":"vocab-headword","idx":3,"text":"widerlegen","voiceRole":"female","pos":"verb","control":"button.vword-voice[data-g=female]","chapter":"b2-67-argumentieren-gegenargumente","level":"B2"},{"section":"vocabulary","type":"vocab-headword","idx":3,"text":"widerlegen","voiceRole":"male","pos":"verb","control":"button.vword-voice[data-g=male]","chapter":"b2-67-argumentieren-gegenargumente","level":"B2"},{"section":"vocabulary","type":"vocab-headword","idx":4,"text":"der Einwand","voiceRole":"female","pos":"noun","gender":"m","control":"button.vword-voice[data-g=female]","chapter":"b2-67-argumentieren-gegenargumente","level":"B2"},{"section":"vocabulary","type":"vocab-headword","idx":4,"text":"der Einwand","voiceRole":"male","pos":"noun","gender":"m","control":"button.vword-voice[data-g=male]","chapter":"b2-67-argumentieren-gegenargumente","level":"B2"},{"section":"vocabulary","type":"vocab-headword","idx":5,"text":"ausgewogen","voiceRole":"female","pos":"adjective","control":"button.vword-voice[data-g=female]","chapter":"b2-67-argumentieren-gegenargumente","level":"B2"},{"section":"vocabulary","type":"vocab-headword","idx":5,"text":"ausgewogen","voiceRole":"male","pos":"adjective","control":"button.vword-voice[data-g=male]","chapter":"b2-67-argumentieren-gegenargumente","level":"B2"},{"section":"reading","type":"reading-passage","idx":1,"text":"Viele Experten argumentieren dass Social Media die Kommunikation erleichtert Dem stehen jedoch psychische Risiken gegenüber Ein weiteres Gegenargument betrifft die Verbreitung von Falschinformationen Trotzdem lässt sich nicht bestreiten dass viele Menschen dank Social Media in Kontakt bleiben Letztlich hängt viel vom verantwortungsvollen Umgang jedes Einzelnen ab","authoredText":"Viele Experten argumentieren, dass Social Media die Kommunikation erleichtert. Dem stehen jedoch psychische Risiken gegenüber. Ein weiteres Gegenargument betrifft die Verbreitung von Falschinformationen. Trotzdem lässt sich nicht bestreiten, dass viele Menschen dank Social Media in Kontakt bleiben. Letztlich hängt viel vom verantwortungsvollen Umgang jedes Einzelnen ab.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","title":"Argumentativer Artikel über Social Media","control":"button \"Listen to passage\"","chapter":"b2-67-argumentieren-gegenargumente","level":"B2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":1,"text":"Ein Gegenargument, das mir noch einfällt: im Homeoffice fühlen sich manche ziemlich einsam.","speaker":"Katrin","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"B2_067_L001","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b2-67-argumentieren-gegenargumente","level":"B2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":2,"text":"Zugegeben, das ist ein wichtiger Punkt, den ich nicht ignorieren sollte.","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"B2_067_L002","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b2-67-argumentieren-gegenargumente","level":"B2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":3,"text":"Aber wie würdest du darauf reagieren?","speaker":"Katrin","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"B2_067_L003","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b2-67-argumentieren-gegenargumente","level":"B2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":4,"text":"Man könnte regelmäßige Teamtreffen einplanen, um genau das auszugleichen.","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"B2_067_L004","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b2-67-argumentieren-gegenargumente","level":"B2"},{"chapter":"b2-67-argumentieren-gegenargumente","level":"B2","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":1,"text":"Ein Gegenargument, das mir noch einfällt: im Homeoffice fühlen sich manche ziemlich einsam.","speaker":"Katrin","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"B2_067_L001","reachable":false},{"chapter":"b2-67-argumentieren-gegenargumente","level":"B2","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":2,"text":"Zugegeben, das ist ein wichtiger Punkt, den ich nicht ignorieren sollte.","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"B2_067_L002","reachable":false},{"chapter":"b2-67-argumentieren-gegenargumente","level":"B2","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":3,"text":"Aber wie würdest du darauf reagieren?","speaker":"Katrin","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"B2_067_L003","reachable":false},{"chapter":"b2-67-argumentieren-gegenargumente","level":"B2","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":4,"text":"Man könnte regelmäßige Teamtreffen einplanen, um genau das auszugleichen.","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"B2_067_L004","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":1,"text":"Zugegeben, das ist ein wichtiger Punkt, den ich nicht bedacht habe.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"b2-67-argumentieren-gegenargumente","level":"B2"},{"chapter":"b2-67-argumentieren-gegenargumente","level":"B2","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":1,"text":"Dein Kollege nennt die Einsamkeit im Homeoffice. Räum es ein.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":2,"text":"Dennoch bin ich überzeugt, dass zwei Bürotage reichen.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"b2-67-argumentieren-gegenargumente","level":"B2"},{"chapter":"b2-67-argumentieren-gegenargumente","level":"B2","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":2,"text":"Antworte auf den Einwand, ohne deine Position aufzugeben.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":3,"text":"Das stärkste Gegenargument ist der fehlende Austausch.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"b2-67-argumentieren-gegenargumente","level":"B2"},{"chapter":"b2-67-argumentieren-gegenargumente","level":"B2","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":3,"text":"Deine Chefin fragt, welches Gegenargument am stärksten ist.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":4,"text":"Das lässt sich mit den Zahlen widerlegen, sie sind gestiegen.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"b2-67-argumentieren-gegenargumente","level":"B2"},{"chapter":"b2-67-argumentieren-gegenargumente","level":"B2","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":4,"text":"Eine Kollegin nennt eine falsche Zahl. Widerlege sie höflich.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":5,"text":"Einerseits sinken die Kosten, andererseits leidet das Team. — Insgesamt halte ich das Modell für ausgewogen.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"b2-67-argumentieren-gegenargumente","level":"B2"},{"chapter":"b2-67-argumentieren-gegenargumente","level":"B2","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":5,"text":"Rollenspiel: Ihr führt eine ausgewogene Diskussion.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false}],"controls":{"story-play-line":6,"story-play-all":1,"vword-voice-F":5,"vword-voice-M":5,"vword-listen":5,"listen-to-passage":1,"audio-play-btn":1,"hear-model":5},"surfaces":[{"n":1,"w":"Gegenargumente","from":"vocab-plural","type":"Noun · plural"},{"n":1,"w":"das","from":"vocab-article","type":"Article"},{"n":1,"w":"Einwände","f